													"width": 656.8173828125,
													"height": 61,
													"text": "Upload only loads the schedule into the builder for review: ICTCService.QueueSchedule() is NOT called here,\nthe dispatcher must still press Queue Schedule. If the dialog is cancelled (ShowDialog() != true) or the file\ncannot be read (IOException / UnauthorizedAccessException), the current template is kept."
												},
