													"top": 1628,
													"width": 538,
													"height": 166,
													"text": "Implementation references:\n- MainWindow.xaml: \"Upload Schedule\" button -> UploadScheduleCommand\n- ScheduleBuilderViewModel.UploadSchedule()\n- Microsoft.Win32.OpenFileDialog.ShowDialog(), System.IO.File.ReadAllText()\n- TrainIds.NextAvailableNumber(CtcSystemState)\n- ScheduleCsvImporter.Import() / TryParseCsv()\n- ScheduleTemplateFactory.Create()\n- ScheduleBuilderViewModel.ShowTemplate() / ClearTemplate()\n- ScheduleTemplateRow.SetTrainTime() / TrySetTrainDwellTime()\n- DwellTimePolicy (default and validation of dwell times)"
												}
											]
										}
									],
