													"top": 150,
													"width": 752,
													"height": 106,
													"text": "Precondition: the train was released by time-triggered dispatch and is in CtcSystemState.DispatchedTrains.\ntrain.CurrentBlockId is maintained from occupancy reports along train.ActiveRouteBlockIds\n(BlockStatusMessage -> CTCService.ApplyBlockStatus() -> TrainLocationTracker.ApplyOccupancy()).\nThat tracking is supporting system behaviour, not part of this use case.\nAt dispatch its Active Movement Plan (train.Stops: destination, arrival and dwell of each remaining stop)\nwas built from the schedule's timed blocks (MovementPlanner.CreateStops())."
												},
