													"height": 241,
													"text": "Implementation references:\n- MainWindow.xaml: Dispatched Trains grid + \"Apply Changes\" button -> ApplyTrainPlanCommand\n- MainWindowViewModel.SelectedDispatchedTrain / SelectedStop / EditedDwellTime / LoadEditedPlan() / ApplyTrainPlanAsync()\n- ScheduleTemplateConverter.TryParseTime()\n- ICTCService.UpdateMovementPlanStopAsync() / CTCService.UpdateMovementPlanStopAsync()\n- DwellTimePolicy.GetDefaultDwellTime() / TryParseSeconds()\n- MovementPlanner.ValidateStopTiming() / RecalculatePlannedSpeeds()\n- CtcSystemState.FindDispatchedTrain() / FindLine()\n- RouteManager.FindRoute()\n- SpeedPlanner.CalculateSpeedToTarget()\n- AuthorityManager.CalculateUpdatedAuthorityMeters()\n- IMessageSender.SendAsync() -> NamedPipeMessageSender.SendAsync()\n- CTCService.ReplaceActiveRoute() / OnStateChanged()\n- MainWindowViewModel.OnCtcStateChanged() / RefreshDispatchedTrain(), DispatchedTrainViewModel.Refresh(), MovementPlanStopViewModel\n- Context only: TrainLocationTracker.ApplyOccupancy() maintains DispatchedTrainState.CurrentBlockId"
