												},
												{
													"_type": "UMLNoteView",
													"_id": "AAAAAAGhldoegn/22tq=",
													"_parent": {
														"$ref": "AAAAAAGhUJqlp2r58Eo="
													},
													"font": "Arial;13;0",
													"parentStyle": false,
													"left": 1351,
													"top": 2643,
													"width": 842,
													"height": 61,
													"text": "Each later movement is planned from the previous stop's Departure = Arrival + Dwell\n(for a train dwelling now: actual arrival + dwell) to the next stop's Arrival:\nspeed = distance / (nextArrival - max(departure, now)) -> MovementPlanStop.PlannedSpeedMetersPerSecond / TimingWarning."
												},
												{
													"_type": "UMLNoteView",
													"_id": "AAAAAAGhK9mIq+6qAE0=",
													"_parent": {
														"$ref": "AAAAAAGhUJqlp2r58Eo="
													},
													"font": "Arial;13;0",
													"parentStyle": false,
													"left": 60,
													"top": 3270,
													"width": 917,
													"height": 76,
													"text": "Afterwards (system behaviour, not part of this use case): when the train enters its current stop, CTCService.ApplyBlockStatus() ->\nMovementPlanner.ApplyTrainAdvanced() sets Phase = Dwelling (Arrived if the dwell is 0). On the SystemTime update at which\nactual arrival + dwell has passed, CTCService.AdvanceMovementPlansAsync() sends the next movement's MovementSuggestion\n(speed from that departure to the next stop's arrival) and the train is EnRoute again; at its final stop it becomes Completed."
												}
											]
										}
									],
									"documentation": "Implementation references:\n- MainWindow.xaml: Dispatched Trains grid + \"Apply Changes\" button -> ApplyTrainPlanCommand\n- MainWindowViewModel.SelectedDispatchedTrain / LoadEditedPlan() / ApplyTrainPlanAsync() / CanApplyTrainPlan()\n- ScheduleTemplateConverter.TryParseTime()\n- ICTCService.UpdateDispatchedTrainPlanAsync() / CTCService.UpdateDispatchedTrainPlanAsync()\n- CtcSystemState.FindDispatchedTrain() / FindLine()\n- RouteManager.FindRoute()\n- SpeedPlanner.CalculateSpeedToTarget()\n- AuthorityManager.CalculateUpdatedAuthorityMeters()\n- IMessageSender.SendAsync() -> NamedPipeMessageSender.SendAsync()\n- CTCService.ReplaceActiveRoute() / OnStateChanged()\n- MainWindowViewModel.OnCtcStateChanged(), DispatchedTrainViewModel.Refresh()\n- Context only: TrainLocationTracker.ApplyOccupancy() maintains DispatchedTrainState.CurrentBlockId",
